                    <CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE-ELEMENT>
                      <SHORT-NAME>props</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="KO">The list of keys defined in the KeyValueMap props is as follows:1. &quot;UpdateState&quot;: Indicates the status of a software releaseThe value of the &quot;UpdateState&quot; key is as follows:- &quot;NewUpdate&quot;: The state of receiving new version information and description information from the server- &quot;DownloadApprovalWaiting&quot;: Display of the download consent popup- &quot;DownloadReady&quot;: Approval of downloading by agreeing- &quot;Downloading&quot;: Download in progress- &quot;DownloadDone&quot;: Download complete- &quot;BackgroundTransferring&quot;: Background transfer in progress- &quot;BackgroundTransferDone&quot;: Background transfer complete- &quot;UpdateApprovalWaiting&quot;: Display of the update consent popup- &quot;UpdateReady&quot;: Approval of update by agreeing- &quot;Updating&quot;: Update in progress- &quot;UpdateDone&quot;: Update complete (including rollback/failure)</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <TYPE-REFERENCE>
                        <INPLACE>false</INPLACE>
                        <TYPE-REFERENCE-REF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/KeyValueMap</TYPE-REFERENCE-REF>
                      </TYPE-REFERENCE>
