              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SubscribeToMessages</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[SOME/IP-TP]
1. VCRM (VDC) will update the array whenever a new policy is received from the cloud.
2. If the array is empty, SOA should not send any messages to VCRM.
3. When the array is updated and a BusAndMessageId is removed from the array, SOA should stop sending that message to VCRM.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>busAndMessageIds</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SubscribeToMessages_busAndMessageIds_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
