                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>System</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>System</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EngineeringMode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>EngineeringMode</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>2</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>0</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ActionLists</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">In the Engineering Mode screen, possible to select the target to collect logs and select the log level.
    When the user clicks the log request button on the device, a new LogAction object is created and the subscribers are receives and performs the that request.
    If the user cancel the request on UI or changes to a system error state(network file transfer fail, usb file transfer fail, timeouts, removed USB media from system) cases, 
    the LogStatus value of the object also changes to Failure.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ActionLists_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>StartLogTransfer</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">When the subscriber returns the log file transfer request, the endpoint ECU should invoke this method to information that it is in a transfer state with total file size and count arguments.The Host will check with this information the availability of usb storage. If the storage is not enough to store, NOT_READY error will return and LogStatus of LogAction will changed to Failed.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>action</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/LogAction</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fileTotalSize</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fileTotalCounts</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint16_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error_of_CommonAPI</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/LogTransferError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>StopLogTransfer</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">When the subscriber finished the log file transfer request, the endpoint ECU should invoke this method to inform that it is in a process Success/Failure state.Subscribers send multiple log files by sequentially.If an error occurs while transferring a file, subscriber have to send it again after 5 seconds up to 5 times. And if reach to 5 times fails, call the StopLogTransfer command to notify host that boolean success field as false. Normally, boolean success field is 'true' when transmission is successful.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>action</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/LogAction</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>success</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/bool</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error_of_CommonAPI</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/LogTransferError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TransferLogFile</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This method is used to transfer each file to a host. Invoke the method with the requested LogAction object, blobs for file and file's meta information.
    If an error occurs while transferring a file, subscriber have to send it again after 5 seconds up to 5 times. And if reach to 5 times fails, call the StopLogTransfer command to notify host.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>action</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/LogAction</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fileName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fileSize</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fileCount</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint16_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fileTotalCounts</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint16_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>blob</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ByteArray</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error_of_CommonAPI</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/TransferError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>EngineeringMode</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Info</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Info</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Cloud</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Cloud</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EngineeringMode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>EngineeringMode</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>2</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>2</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Environments</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Indicates the information on the service environment.   The users able to change the operating environments transition from engineering mode. That case the Environments field is changed.    This field is changed to the &quot;Default&quot; if the override is no longer performed.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/InfrastructureEnvironments</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EnvironmentsAddress</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This information represents the override basic connection information for connecting connections.    Permitted Key Lists on Provisioning Table   -CCS.host    -CCS.port</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/KeyValue</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TestIdentifiers</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">The values of this data structure are applied first as a vehicle identifier when connecting a connected car service. 	If an identifier value has been overridden in engineering mode, overridden full list is kepted. removed field will not listed. 	Permitted Key Lists on Test Identifiers 	-VIN</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/KeyValue</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TimeStamp</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Indicates the timestamp that field is updated when the engineering mode item renewed.
    The format is following to &quot;YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM:SS&quot;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetProvisioningStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get Provisioning Status that was overridden in Engineering Mode.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>status</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ProvisioningStatus</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetTestICCID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get a Test ICCID Number (Dummy ICCID)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>iccid</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetTestIMSI</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get a Test IMSI Number (Dummy IMSI)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>imsi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetTestMDN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get a Test MDN Number. (Dummy MDN)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>mdn</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetTestMSISDN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get a Test MSISDN Number (Dummy MSISDN)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>msisdn</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetTestVIN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get a Test VIN Number (Dummy VIN)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>vin</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ResetProvisioningStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Reset the override provisioning status.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>status</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ProvisioningStatus</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetProvisioningStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Force override the provisioning status manually
    Field ProvisioningStatus of Info.Cloud.ProvisioningTable will be effected.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>status</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ProvisioningStatus</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetTestICCID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set the Test ICCID Number (Dummy ICCID)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>iccid</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetTestIMSI</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set the Test IMSI Number (Dummy IMSI)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>imsi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetTestMDN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set the Test MDN Number. (Dummy MDN)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>mdn</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetTestMSISDN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set the Test MSISDN Number (Dummy MSISDN)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>msisdn</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetTestVIN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set the Test VIN Number (Dummy VIN)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>vin</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>EngineeringMode</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>CCU</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>System</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>System</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EngineeringMode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>EngineeringMode</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>0</MINOR-VERSION>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetProperty</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Get property value(s) for System's Engineering Mode.  Value field is defined as an array of strings. Since it is a string array, can handle all of cases where there is no value, one and more values with single interface.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>keyinfo</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error_of_CommonAPI</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/PropertyError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>valueinfo</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetProperty_valueinfo_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetProperty</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set property value(s) for System's Engineering Mode.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>keyinfo</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>valueinfo</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error_of_CommonAPI</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/PropertyError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>EthernetSwitchMgr</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Vehicle</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Vehicle</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EthHandler</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>EthHandler</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EthernetSwitchMgr</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>EthernetSwitchMgr</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>1</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EmtLinkUp</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/bool</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>DownloadImage</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This function download the switch image to the switch flash</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>imageFilePath</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/EthOtaError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EnableERTLogging</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Control ERT port VLAN / True : on, False : Off / option : reserved</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>onOff</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/bool</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>option</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>FinishImage</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>error</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/EthOtaError</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetConfigurationVersion</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This function returns the current running switch configuration version</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>version</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
