                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ChangeIVNRule</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Service interface method to request for turning on/off specific IVN rules from consumers request. This method will have string aliases to mapping string to port like the following.

NSS_RPC_BIND : 111
NSS_SSH_TUNNEL : 2048
NSS_NFS : 2049
NSS_MOUND : 54263
NSS_STATD : 54264
NSS_LOCKD : 54265
NSS_LOCKD_UDP : 54266

It will be used in parameter “types” and if “onOff” is true, this method will allow rules and if it is false, this method will remove rules.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
