                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">When performing a remote standby shutdown notification scenario, the CCU notifies the DCU that it is performing a reporting procedure.  This process allows the DCU to lower the WAKEUP PIN. It's like clearing a message in an SMS MT scenario.</L-2>
