                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RequestDiag</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Request Diag to other ECU using the estasblished session handle.
Apply greater value between RequestDiag::STmin and Response MSG FlowControl::STmin.
App can set a timeout time by timeout parameter, unit is ms, temporary minimum time is 300ms (ex, 10ms : 0x0A)
If timeout set to less than 300ms, it is set to 300ms.
Default timeout is 2000ms, timeout = 0 set to the default time.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>diagClientID</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
