                  <SHORT-NAME>RoutingTP</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>RoutingTP</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>0</MINOR-VERSION>
              <EVENTS>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TP_IAU_CCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/TP_IAU_CCU_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
              </EVENTS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TP_CCU_IAU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>tpMessage</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ByteArray</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/TPResultType</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>S2S</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>CCU</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Vehicle</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Vehicle</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>S2S</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>S2S</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>3</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>9</MINOR-VERSION>
              <EVENTS>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendBatCellInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This event sends the battInfo for NemsData. 
    The battinfo will be Voltage or Temperature of battCells according to the value of signal(NEV_BMS_GROUPSEL).
    CCU can get 26signals of battInfo and 2signals(NEV_BMS_GroupSel, NEV_BMS_StartNo) in 50ms, also collect these signals for 1 sec. 
    Then CCU sends it to DCU every 1 sec. 
    P Period : 1 second</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendBatCellInfo_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendBatWarnData</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This is a battery warning data for battery auto cut signal forwarding.  
    P Period : 1 Second</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendBatWarnData_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendCommonData</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This is the CommonData for both eCall and NEMS needed.
    Clu_xxxx data should be sent as the same value with the final data from CAN.
    PropulsionStorage data should be sent after CCU determine the propulsion type of the car.
    This event is included in both Eventgroup#1 and Eventgroup#2.
    Array data type payload is applied on event to send/receive different EthCC signals at the same time.
    P Period : 1 Second</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendCommonData_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendECallData</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This is the ECallData for eCall signal forwarding.  
Array data type payload is applied on event to send/receive different CAN(EthCC) signals at the same time. When a specific signal is not transmitted, the CCU fills the value with AtStartValue(0) and transmits it to the DCU.

CCU transmits either signal such as below; 

The old signal list of seatbltValue : Warn_DrvStBltSwSta, Warn_AsstStBltSwSta, Warn_RrCtrStBltSwSta, Warn_RrLftStBltSwSta, Warn_RrRtStBltSwSta, C_3rdRCSeatBeltSW, C_3rdRLSeatBeltSW, C_3rdRRSeatBeltSW
The Meaning of seatbltValue:0(unbelted), 1(belted), the other number like -1,2,3,4...(invalid)     PE Period : 1 Second

The new signal list of seatbltValue : SeatBeltSwSta_Drv, SeatBeltSwSta_1stCtr, SeatBeltSwSta_Asst, SeatBeltSwSta_2ndLft, SeatBeltSwSta_2ndCtr, SeatBeltSwSta_2ndRt, SeatBeltSwSta_3rdLft, SeatBeltSwSta_3rdCtr, SeatBeltSwSta_3rdRt,SeatBeltSwSta_4thLft,SeatBeltSwSta_4thCtr,SeatBeltSwSta_4thRt
The Meaning of seatbltValue:0(unbelted), 1(belted), 2(not supported),3(virgin mode). the other number like -1,...(invalid)     PE Period : 1 Second</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendECallData_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendECallData_RealTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This is the ECallData for eCall signal forwarding.
Array data type payload is applied on event to send/receive different CAN(EthCC) signals at the same time.
CCU relays each item in real time to DCU.
	
※ Acu_Dtc, Acu_FltStat, Acu_NumOfFlt signals are sent depending on whether ACU_03 message is received.
   Mapping information when ACU_03 message is received : ISCM_DiagTrblCodVal_3Byte, ISCM_ActvFltSta, ISCM_FltNumVal
   Mapping information when ACU_03 message is not received : ACU_DiagTrblCodVal, ACU_ActvFltSta, ACU_FltNumVal</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendECallData_RealTime_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendFCData</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">P Period : 1 Second → Last Value? ?
Array data type payload is applied on event to send/receive different CAN(EthCC) signals at the same time.? ?
This value is sent every 1 second.? 
?Each value should be sent as the last value.

Initial value is 0xFFFFFFFF.

? ?Struct NemsFCSignal {         
     NemsFCSignal_toIP SignalItem   
     Uint32 SignalValue 
}
 ?enumeration NemsFCSignal_toIP {
      FSVM_VltSum             
      FCU_FcCur
      FCU_AvgFuelEcoVal
      FCU_FcInClntTmp
      FCU_FcOutClntTmp
      HMU1_TnkTmp1
      HMU1_TnkTmp2
      HMU1_TnkTmp3
      FCU_FpsH2Cnc
      FCU_FcH2Cnc
      HMU1_H2Sns1
      HMU1_HighPrs
      BHDC_Ctrb
}</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendFCData_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendIdcCurrentData</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">P Period : 1 Second → Last Value

Array data type payload is applied on event to send/receive different CAN(EthCC) signals at the same time.

This value is sent every 1 second.

Each value should be sent as the last value.

SendIdcCurrentData transmit only when the value of VariationInfo is applicable.
    VariationInfo::ECALL - Not Applicable
    VariationInfo::NEMS - Applicable
    VariationInfo::ECALL_NEMS - Applicable

If the SendIdcCurrentData is not initially received, the initial value is skipped.


Struct NemsIdcCurrent {
        NemsIdcCurrent_toIP SignalItem
        Unit32 SignalValue
}

enumeration NemsIdcCurrent_toIP {
                 MCU_Mg1IdcCurrent
                 MCU_Mg2IdcCurrent
}</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendIdcCurrentData_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendNemsData</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Array data type payload is applied on event to send/receive different CAN(EthCC) signals at the same time.
    This value is sent every 1 second. Each value should be sent as the last value.
    P Period : 1 Second → Last Value</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SendNemsData_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
              </EVENTS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetACNSignallist</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">When a specific signal is not transmitted, the CCU fills the value with 0xFFFFFFFF and transmits it to the DCU.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>dataList</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetACNSignallist_dataList_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetBattNumInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">When a specific signal is not transmitted, the CCU fills the value with 0xFFFF and transmits it to the DCU.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>dataList</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetBattNumInfo_dataList_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetEngineStatusInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This is Engine status signals forwarding.
When a specific signal is not transmitted, the CCU fills the value with 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF and transmits it to the DCU.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>ENG_EngSta</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>HCU_HevRdySta</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>VCU_EvDrvRdySta</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetPropulsionStorage</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Indicates the PropulsionStorage of the car.    Depending on the vehicle type, the output parameter is filled or not.     ex) Gasoline/Diesel/LPG/Other/Unused: input engtyp2 signal and the rest of can(hcu,bms,vcu,fcu) are set to NULL.     other vehicles like EV: Depending on the vehicle type,    the specific can message including singal is filled and the rest of output value are set to NULL. And if an engtyp2 singal is not received, the CCU sends a 0xE(not used) value to the DCU</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>engtyp2</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>hcu</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetPropulsionStorage_hcu_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>bms</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetPropulsionStorage_bms_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>vcu</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetPropulsionStorage_vcu_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>fcu</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/GetPropulsionStorage_fcu_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetPropulsionStorage_HEV</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Indicates the PropulsionStorage of the HEV car.
In the case of a HEV vehicle, the HEV_EngTyp2 signal in the EMS_08_100ms MSG is transmitted.
If HEV_EngTyp2 signal is not received, the CCU sends a 0xE(Not used) value to the DCU.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>hev_EngTyp2</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetVehicleSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This method is defined to forwarding the DCU's CAN(EthCC) signal to the CCU.
    Value Tables of DCU_eCall Signal
        0x00: No Action
        0x01: eCall Mode
        0x02: eCall Termination
        0x03: Test Mode
        0x04: Manual eCall Mode
        0x05: Reserved
        0x06: Reserved
        0x07: Invalid</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>signalID</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/Signal_toCAN</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>valueinfo</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
