            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>Screen</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>CCU</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>FoD</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>FoD</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Screen</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Screen</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>4</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>FoDExecutionProgress</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[Deprecated] 추후 ProgressBar 적용 필요 시 사용
A gauge value to display progress bar when executing FoD.

Possible values: 0 ~ 100</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>FoDMenu</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[Deprecated] FOD-A 시나리오 (H/U 에서 직접 취득)
It has the purpose of displaying the screen for FoD products with a history of execution in the vehicle.

Permitted Key Lists on FoDMenu
&quot;FodItemName&quot;: FoD Item Name
&quot;FodPackagesType&quot;: Package Type
&quot;PreEndYear&quot;: Preview Ending Year (Year) - YYYY (1900~2100) / Optional
&quot;PreEndMonth&quot;: Preview Ending Year (Month) - MM (01~12) / Optional
&quot;PreEndDay&quot;: Preview Ending Year (Day) - DD (01~31) / Optional
&quot;SubscribeType&quot;: Subscribe Type / Optional
&quot;URL&quot;: URL link for detail information / Optional</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/FoDMenu_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>FoDPackage</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This information has the purpose of being displayed on the screen during the FoD execution process in the vehicle.
It contains package information about purchased products.

Permitted Key Lists on FoDPackage.
&quot;FodItemID&quot;: FoD Item ID
&quot;FodItemName&quot;: FoD Item Name
&quot;FodPackagesType&quot;: Package Type
&quot;PreStartYear&quot;: Preview Starting Date (Year) - YYYY (1900~2100) / Optional
&quot;PreStartMonth&quot;: Preview Starting Date (Month) - MM (01~12) / Optional
&quot;PreStartDay&quot;: Preview Starting Date (Day) - DD (01~31) / Optional
&quot;PreEndYear&quot;: Preview Ending Year (Year) - YYYY (1900~2100) / Optional
&quot;PreEndMonth&quot;: Preview Ending Year (Month) - MM (01~12) / Optional
&quot;PreEndDay&quot;: Preview Ending Year (Day) - DD (01~31) / Optional
&quot;PreRemainingDay&quot;: Preview Remaining Day (Day) - DD (00 ~ 99) / Optional
“TutorialURL”: Tutorial URL
”ServiceCenterURL”: Service Center URL
“ExecuteResult”: Execution Success, Failure Information / Optional
“FoDUIReadyRequest”: FoD UI Ready Request
[Deprecated] “FoDExcutionProgress”: FoD Execution rate for Progress bar</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/FoDPackage_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>FoDUIReadyRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[Deprecated] FoDPackage내 Key/Value 사용
Information to request HU to maintain screen even after IG is off.

Possible Values
0: Off(Not maintain screen after IG is off)
1: On(Maintain screen after IG is off)</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>IndexID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Identifier for FoD screens that displayed during the FoD execution process.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint16_t</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UnrecognizedRejectReason</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Indicates detailed reason for UnrecognizedReject by HU internal logic.
Format : &quot;001&quot;, &quot;002&quot;, ~ &quot;999&quot; 

//001 : Valet mode
//002 : Force Update
//003 : AVNT OTA
//004 : Power State Change (ACC ON, IGN ON)
//005 : ADM logic off 
//006 : Screen Transition</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>true</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetFoDPackage</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Set FoDPackage.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>FoDPackages</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SetFoDPackage_FoDPackages_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
