              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CureentSDSAuthenticationLevel</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[NE1aW] SDS 인증 대응용 API / Inform when SDS Authentication is changed
userRole bitmask:
Bit 0: Default/Anybody
Bit 1: OEM servicing
Bit 2: enhanced
Bit 3: operations
Bit 4: basic
Bit 5: All functional
Bit 6: Rollback
Bit 7: reserved

diagRoutingRole bitmask:
Bit 0: Onboard DoIP (SDS)
Bit 1: Offboard DoIP (ERT)
Bit 2: Diagnostics CAN (EDT)
Bit 3: Disable Flooding protection
Bit 4: Airbag deployment (CCU 미사용)
Bit 5~7: reserved</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/CertRole</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CurrentAuthenticationLevel</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/AuthLevelType</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CurrentCommunicationMode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/CommunicationState</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CurrentDiagSession</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/DiagSessionType</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CurrentSecurityLevel</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SecurityLevelType</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
