              <EVENTS>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>OnShutdown</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Event used to notify Client Managers to disconnect from NSS and NFS.
&quot;OTA_UPDATE&quot; : 
This means that AppModeType.appModeOta is Update_preprocess(0x5)~Update_other(0x7). During OTA update process, DNMT is triggered and it can afftect to disable SOME/IP interface and nfs transmittion
&quot;CCU_SHUTDOWN&quot; :
This means that APState is NODE_SHUTDOWN</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/OnShutdown_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
              </EVENTS>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>PolicyApplied</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Event used to notify Client Managers that current NSS policy was changed and that they should request an updated client policy.
statusCode : status information for applying policy
errorMessage : error message for applying policy
policyVersion : This parameter indicates the policy version applied by NSS.
name : The policy name applied by NSS.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/PolicyInfo</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>IsShareAvailable</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Method used by internal client to determine if the share with provided path is ready to be used by client application.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>sharePath</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/bool</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>Share</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>CCU</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SharedStorage</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>SharedStorage</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Share</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Share</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>1</MINOR-VERSION>
              <EVENTS>
                <VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>OnShutdown</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Event used to notify Client Managers to disconnect from NSS and NFS.

&quot;OTA_UPDATE&quot; : 
This means that AppModeType.appModeOta is Update_preprocess(0x5)~Update_other(0x7). During OTA update process, DNMT is triggered and it can afftect to disable SOME/IP interface and nfs transmittion

&quot;CCU_SHUTDOWN&quot; :
This means that APState is NODE_SHUTDOWN</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/OnShutdown_EventData</TYPE-TREF>
                </VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
              </EVENTS>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>PolicyApplied</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Event used to notify Client Managers that current NSS policy was changed,
and that they should request an updated client policy. 
- statusCode : status information for applying policy
- errorMessage : error message for applying policy
- policyVersion : This parameter indicates the policy version applied by NSS.
- name : The policy name applied by NSS.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/PolicyInfo</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetPolicyForClient</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Returns current client policy JSON string with current shares’ details to be mounted on the client (ECU) running Client Manager.
- result : Returns current client policy JSON string with current shares’ details to be mounted on the client (ECU) running Client Manager.
- checksum : Checksum of the policy JSON string</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>clientIpAddress</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>checksum</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ReportPolicyApplicationStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Method used to notify NSS about the Client Manager policy application status

- policyApplicationStatus: 
&quot;APPLIED&quot;
&quot;NOT_CHANGED&quot;
&quot;INVALID_JSON&quot;
&quot;EMPTY&quot;
&quot;SSH_TUNNEL_OPEN_FAILED&quot;
&quot;MOUNT_FAILED&quot;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>policyApplicationStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>clientIpAddress</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>policyName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>policyVersion</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ReportStatistics</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Method used to periodically post clients statistics to the NSS.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>stats</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>clientIpAddress</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SendClientShutdownStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Method used to send the Client Manager disconnection status to the NSS.

- clientShutdownStatus :
&quot;OK&quot;
&quot;UNMOUNT_FAILED&quot;
&quot;SSH_TUNNEL_CLOSE_FAILED&quot;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>clientShutdownStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>clientIpAddress</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>SimManager</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Vehicle</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Vehicle</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>MSM</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>MSM</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SimManager</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>SimManager</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>2</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>IccID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>MCC</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>MNC</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>NetSerProv</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/NetworkServiceProvider</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>PhoneNumber</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>SimManager</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>DCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>DCU</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Telephony</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Telephony</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SimManager</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>SimManager</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>2</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>0</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CardIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the Integrated Circuit Card Identifer (ICCID) which is read directly from the SIM.
    The CardIdentifier value is used for CCS service opening process.
	According to the HMC specification, If the actual SIM card's ICCID is 19 digits, the 'F' character is appended to the last character.
	If the ICCID is 20 digits, it is returned without additional characters.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>EID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the eUICC Indentifier (EID)
    EID is the eUICC identifier used in the context of Remote Provisioning and Management of the eUICC.
    Examplesof valid EIDs are:
    8900 1012 0123 4123 4012 3456 7890 1224
    8900 1567 0102 0304 0506 0708 0910 1152
    8904 4011 1122 3344 1122 3344 1122 3321</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>MCC</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the Mobile Country Code (MCC) of the home network (HPLMN).
    When Remote SIM Provisioning has been performed, the MVNO information (MCC / MNC value) also changed.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>MNC</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the Mobile Network Code (MNC) of the home network (HPLMN).
    When Remote SIM Provisioning has been performed, the MVNO information (MCC / MNC value) also changed.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>MSISDN</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the MSISDN of the SIM.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>NetworkOTAStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Representing the network OTA status.
    CCS Provisiong can only be performed when in the Activated state.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/NetworkOTAStatus</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>PhoneNumber</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the subscriber's number of the SIM.
    The initial value of PhoneNumber is filled by many 0.
    If the Teleco OTA Status is changed to Activated, the PhoneNumber is changed to the actual phone number.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ServiceProviderName</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the service provider name fetched from the SIM card, if available.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Status</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">SIM status.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/bool</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SubscriberIdentity</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Contains the IMSI of the SIM, if available.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>OpeningDate</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Representing the device opening date of the modem device.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>open</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/OpeningDateInfo</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RequestNetworkOTA</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Perform Network OTA Request to NAD.
    Temporarily allow the modem to be reattached to the carrier's network.
    When NetworkOTAStatus changes to Activated state, CCS provisioning can be performed.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>StateManager</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Vehicle</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Vehicle</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SM</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>SM</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>StateManager</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>StateManager</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>1</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>APState</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SMState</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>NetRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/NetworkRequest</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SessionStateField</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SessionStateField_VECTOR</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>PMStateInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">PM 상태 전달 api
0: Power Off
1: Power On Init
2: Normal Level 1
3: Pre-Normal Level 2
4: Normal Level 2
5 Prepare Shutdown
6: Network Shutdown
7: AP Shutdown
8: System Shutdown
9: Reset
10: Reset Pending
11: Update</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>pmState</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RegisterShutdownNode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>nodeInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/ShutdownNodeInfo</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/Result</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetSessionState</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>state</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SessionState</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>result</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/Result</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ShutdownPendingRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>appName</SHORT-NAME>
