                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TimeSource</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">The TimeSource field is to determine the type of time source provided.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/TimeSource</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>Time</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>DCU</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>DCU</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>System</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>System</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Time</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Time</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>2</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>2</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SystemTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Notify time information to subscribers with 30 sec periodic message.
Remark. This SystemTime information is the System Time of DCU's Linux OS which is not guarantee that the network time calibrated.
valid field indicates whether time information has been calibrated with Network Time Information (NITZ).

Depending on the DCU hardware variation, System Time is calibarted by different options as follows:
1.CCS Only: System Time Calibrated with NITZ
2.CCS + eCall: System Time Calibrated with GPS (secondary source NITZ)
3.CCS + NEMS: System Time Calibrated with GPS (secondary source NITZ)

Note : For compatibility support with older versions (v2.01 and below) of the interface, the utcoff value of this structure is always expressed in seconds. Please refer Field UtcOffset instead of utcoff in struct SystemTime.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SystemTime</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UtcOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This Field indicates the UTC Offset of SystemTime in Minute.
If you can refer to the Field UtcOffset field instead of Int16 utcoff in System Time, use this field to avoid overflow value.
Note: There is an overflow issue when reporting UTC information in seconds. (Happened at v2.01 and below).
For example, in some regions, such as Australia, the offset is UTC+10=36000 seconds, but the int16 (-32,768 to 32,767) data format can be -29536.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/int16_t</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>Time</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Info</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Info</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>System</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>System</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Time</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Time</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>1</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ClockSource</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This field is used to get the clock source used by the head unit.
The ClockSource has the following format and is a string with uppercase letters.
- &quot;INVALID&quot;
- &quot;GPS&quot;
- &quot;RTC&quot;
- &quot;NTP&quot;
- &quot;MANUAL&quot;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>DaylightSavingTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This field is used to know if DST(Daylight Saving Time) is enabled or not.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/bool</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>DisplayedTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[Periodic 30s] Notify time information to subscribers with 30 sec periodic message.
Provide the time information displayed on the UI according to the headunit specification.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SystemTime</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SystemTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">[Periodic 30s] Notify time information to subscribers with 30 sec periodic message.  Provide the time information displayed on the UI according to the headunit specification.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/SystemTime</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TimeZoneID</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This field is used to get the time zone which is configured to headunit.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/TimeZoneID</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UTCOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">This field is used to get the UTC time Offset</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/UTCOffset</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UserOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">User Offset of SystemTime in Minute.	</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/int32_t</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>TimeManager</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Vehicle</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Vehicle</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>ApSysMgr</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>ApSysMgr</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>TimeManager</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>TimeManager</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>1</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>CurrentTimeMode</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">provide the TimeMode to each app by field type.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/TimeMode</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
              <METHODS>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetCurrentEpochTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>time</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/EpochTime</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetCurrentTime</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>time</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/Time</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetMCUSysTick</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">Time Tick Register 값 취득하여 전달하는 api
Invalid시 0 전달</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>mcuSysTick</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetRtcWakeupTimer</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">get the Timer value for presetTimer and currentCountTimer.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>timer</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/Timer</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>appID</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>err</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetSourceTimeValidity</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">0x0 : Default
0x1 : RTC based System Time Applied (UTC Offset 0)
0x2 : HU CAN Clock (Local Time, UTC Offset Applied)
0x3 : Both of AP &amp; HU Clock invalid</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>sourceTimeValidity</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>GetSystemTickOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>offset</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>SetRtcWakeupTimer</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">set the timer by second and enable rtc wakeup function.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>presetTimerSec</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint64_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>appID</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>err</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                <CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
                  <SHORT-NAME>StopRtcWakeupTimer</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="KO">stop rtc wakeup timer</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ARGUMENTS>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>appID</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/String</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>IN</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                    <ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                      <SHORT-NAME>err</SHORT-NAME>
                      <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/uint8_t</TYPE-TREF>
                      <DIRECTION>OUT</DIRECTION>
                    </ARGUMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                  </ARGUMENTS>
                </CLIENT-SERVER-OPERATION>
              </METHODS>
            </SERVICE-INTERFACE>
            <SERVICE-INTERFACE>
              <SHORT-NAME>UdsReprogram</SHORT-NAME>
              <NAMESPACES>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>Vehicle</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>Vehicle</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>VSUA</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>VSUA</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
                <SYMBOL-PROPS>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UdsReprogram</SHORT-NAME>
                  <SYMBOL>UdsReprogram</SYMBOL>
                </SYMBOL-PROPS>
              </NAMESPACES>
              <MAJOR-VERSION>1</MAJOR-VERSION>
              <MINOR-VERSION>0</MINOR-VERSION>
              <FIELDS>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UpdateVehicleSystemDiagClient</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/UpdateVehicleSystemDiagClientType</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
                <FIELD>
                  <SHORT-NAME>UpdateVehicleSystemStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                  <TYPE-TREF DEST="STD-CPP-IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE">/DataType/Implementation/CPP/UpdateVehicleSystemStatusType</TYPE-TREF>
                  <HAS-GETTER>true</HAS-GETTER>
                  <HAS-NOTIFIER>true</HAS-NOTIFIER>
                  <HAS-SETTER>false</HAS-SETTER>
                </FIELD>
              </FIELDS>
